# MaxMind geoipupdate configuration for speedward (placeholders only).
#
# Copy it outside the repository, fill in your own values and keep it private:
#   mkdir -p ~/geo && cp docs/GeoIP.conf.example ~/geo/GeoIP.conf && chmod 600 ~/geo/GeoIP.conf
# The licence key is a secret like GLOBALPING_TOKEN: never commit this file (GeoIP.conf is
# git-ignored), never paste it into .env for a non-Docker run, and keep it out of logs.
# scripts/update_geoip.sh refuses to run while the file is readable by other users.

AccountID YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID
LicenseKey YOUR_LICENSE_KEY
EditionIDs GeoLite2-City

# Where the database is written. scripts/update_geoip.sh passes -d "${GEOIP_DIR:-$HOME/geo}",
# which overrides this line; set it only if you run geoipupdate yourself.
# DatabaseDirectory /home/YOU/geo
